*MATEQ   MATRIX EQUATION                                                        
MATEQF SXD COMMON+00000,4,00000                    SAVE REGS            MATEQ001
       SXD COMMON-00008,2,00000                                         MATEQ002
       SXD COMMON-00009,1,00000                                         MATEQ003
       ARS 00018,0,00000                                                M1T5Q004
       STA MATEQF+00075,0,00000                    SET UP A(II) TEMP    M1T5Q005
       PXD 00000,0,00000                                                M1T5Q006
       LLS 00017,0,00000                                                M1T5Q007
       STO COMMON-00001,0,00000                    STORE B(II) PERM     M1T5Q008
       STA MATEQF+00172,0,00000                    SET UP B(II) TEMP    M1T5Q009
       STA MATEQF+00174,0,00000                                         M1T5Q010
       STA MATEQF+00235,0,00000                                         M1T5Q011
       STA MATEQF+00233,0,00000                                         M1T5Q012
